### 합병 정렬 (Merge Sort)

**분할 정복(Divide and Conquer)** 방식:
1. 배열을 절반으로 분할
2. 각 절반을 재귀적으로 정렬
3. 두 정렬된 배열을 합병(merge)

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>

void merge(int list[], int left, int mid, int right) {
    int i = left, j = mid + 1, k = left;
    int *temp = (int*)malloc((right + 1) * sizeof(int));

    while (i <= mid && j <= right) {
        if (list[i] <= list[j])
            temp[k++] = list[i++];
        else
            temp[k++] = list[j++];
    }
    while (i <= mid)   temp[k++] = list[i++];
    while (j <= right) temp[k++] = list[j++];

    for (i = left; i <= right; i++)
        list[i] = temp[i];
    free(temp);
}

void merge_sort(int list[], int left, int right) {
    if (left < right) {
        int mid = (left + right) / 2;
        merge_sort(list, left, mid);
        merge_sort(list, mid + 1, right);
        merge(list, left, mid, right);
    }
}

int main(void) {
    int list[] = {27, 10, 12, 20, 25, 13, 15};
    int n = 7;
    merge_sort(list, 0, n - 1);
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
        printf("%d ", list[i]);
    return 0;
}
// 출력: 10 12 13 15 20 25 27
```

### 합병 정렬 과정

```
[27, 10, 12, 20, 25, 13, 15]
    ↓ 분할
[27, 10, 12]  [20, 25, 13, 15]
    ↓ 분할 반복
[27][10, 12]  [20, 25][13, 15]
    ↓ 합병
[10, 27][12]  → [10, 12, 27]
    ↓ 합병
[10, 12, 13, 15, 20, 25, 27]
```

